# game/ep3.rpy:2
translate chinese ep3_029db0c9:

    # k "Could you please stop mentioning his name? The man was already long gone."
    k "你能别再提他的名字了吗？他都已经去世很久了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3
translate chinese ep3_ec93799a:

    # k "Can't you just... move on with your life, huh? Hera?"
    k "你就不能……放下那些，专心生活吗，赫拉？"

# game/ep3.rpy:4
translate chinese ep3_bdf84644:

    # k "Playing with our lives isn't enough for you? What else do you want?"
    k "玩弄我们的生活还不够吗？你还想要什么？"

# game/ep3.rpy:5
translate chinese ep3_24078603:

    # h "Let's just say..."
    h "可以说……"

# game/ep3.rpy:6
translate chinese ep3_7ce56e51:

    # h "...I want nothing but entertainment."
    h "……我想要的只有乐子而已。"

# game/ep3.rpy:7
translate chinese ep3_87c23a05:

    # h "Is that reason good enough for you?"
    h "这个理由你觉得足够吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:10
translate chinese ep3_5f1cac66:

    # k "Entertainment?"
    k "乐子？"

# game/ep3.rpy:11
translate chinese ep3_9923709e:

    # k "Entertainment, you say?"
    k "你哪来的脸这么说？"

# game/ep3.rpy:12
translate chinese ep3_fcf740bb:

    # k "My husband died because of you! You used your own daughter to make my [tenant!t] suffer because you couldn't move on with what happened to us in the past..."
    k "我的丈夫因为你才死的！而且就因为你放不下过去的事情，你还利用你女儿让我[tenant!t]受苦……"

# game/ep3.rpy:13
translate chinese ep3_de908d24:

    # k "...and now, you're telling me that you just want entertainment?!"
    k "……现在你居然敢跟我说你只是想找乐子？！"

# game/ep3.rpy:14
translate chinese ep3_2677cabe:

    # k "How can you stomach all the devious things you've done to us?"
    k "你那样对我们，居然还能心安理得地活着？"

# game/ep3.rpy:15
translate chinese ep3_4fc1aa53:

    # h "That's who I am, Klara. You are fully aware of who I am and what I am capable of."
    h "我就是这种人，克拉拉。你很清楚我到底是个什么人，也很清楚我的能力。"

# game/ep3.rpy:16
translate chinese ep3_2788a961:

    # h "You should've thought about it more carefully when you stole Jovian from me."
    h "你当初把乔维安从我身边抢走的时候就没考虑过今天吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:19
translate chinese ep3_f9ba8cb6:

    # k "Stole? He chose me instead of you. I did nothing to take his attention away from you, Hera."
    k "抢？他只是选了我，而不是你而已。我根本没做任何把他抢过来的事，赫拉。"

# game/ep3.rpy:20
translate chinese ep3_a038850e:

    # h "He was supposed to marry me instead of you. But you shattered all my plans, and now I will do the same with your lives."
    h "他该跟我结婚的，最后却变成了你丈夫！你把我的计划全都毁了，现在我也要把你们的生活全都毁掉。"

# game/ep3.rpy:21
translate chinese ep3_dc4ac1ad:

    # k "One more move from you, and this won't stay between just you and me anymore, Hera."
    k "你再敢出手，那就不只是咱们两个人之间的恩怨了，赫拉。"

# game/ep3.rpy:24
translate chinese ep3_351985f5:

    # h "Hmp... What can you do? Report me to the authorities? I control the law, Klara. Now that Jovian is gone, there's nothing you can do against me."
    h "呵……你能怎么办？向警察告发我？法律都由我掌控，克拉拉。在乔维安死了之后，你没有任何手段对付我了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:25
translate chinese ep3_0cc722a8:

    # h "I know what you've been doing all this time. And I know for a fact that my daughter is staying with your [tenant!t] right now."
    h "我知道你一直以来都在干些什么。我也知道我女儿现在和你[tenant!t]住在一起。"

# game/ep3.rpy:26
translate chinese ep3_5e55dd30:

    # h "I know what your plan is, Klara. You're just as dirty as I am. *chuckles*"
    h "我知道你有什么计划，克拉拉。你跟我一样肮脏下作。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:27
translate chinese ep3_a527c32b:

    # k "I have no idea about what you're saying, but if you think I am doing something like you do, then you're mistaken."
    k "我完全不知道你在说些什么，但你要是觉得我会做跟你一样的事情，那你就大错特错了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:28
translate chinese ep3_176b5854:

    # k "I may not have told my [tenant!t] about it, and that's selfish of me, I know. But all I want is for them to understand and forgive each other."
    k "我没有把事情告诉我[tenant!t]，这很自私，我知道。但我只想让他们互相和解、互相原谅。"

# game/ep3.rpy:29
translate chinese ep3_d7dcff41:

    # k "Whether they want to do that or not, is totally up to them."
    k "至于他们会不会那么做，就是他们自己的决定了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:30
translate chinese ep3_cb9aabce:

    # k "You may have been my best friend long ago, but don't put me into the same box as you are, Hera."
    k "你过去确实是我最好的朋友，但是别把我想成跟你一样的人。"

# game/ep3.rpy:31
translate chinese ep3_86ee92d7:

    # k "If you want something, come to me. Don't drag the kids into our issues."
    k "你要是想报复，冲我来就是了。别把孩子卷进我们的事里。"

# game/ep3.rpy:34
translate chinese ep3_92632a04:

    # k "Now, if you'll excuse me, I don't want to waste my time talking nonsense with you."
    k "你要是没有别的事，那就这样吧。我不想浪费时间跟你谈这些。"

# game/ep3.rpy:35
translate chinese ep3_d01fb531:

    # h "*chuckles* Well then, good luck with your endeavour. Tell your [tenant!t] I said 'Hi', will you?"
    h "*笑* 好吧，那我衷心祝愿你的努力最后会得到回报。向你[tenant!t]转达一下我的问候，行吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:36
translate chinese ep3_e8637320:

    # k "Hmp..."
    k "哼……"

# game/ep3.rpy:44
translate chinese ep3_fdf510b2:

    # k "{i}*sighs* A problem as soon as I set foot on the country...{/i}"
    k "{i}*叹气* 一回国就立马出了问题……{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:47
translate chinese ep3_c42f083e:

    # k "{i}Anyway... I wonder what are those two doing right now.{/i}"
    k "{i}总之……我想知道那两个孩子现在怎么样了。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:48
translate chinese ep3_74994e47:

    # k "{i}I haven't been able to contact them since I was overseas.{/i}"
    k "{i}在国外的时候一直没法联络他们。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:49
translate chinese ep3_0d9960df:

    # k "{i}In any case, I should call to inform them that I'll be coming home soon. I just have to finish some business in this city first.{/i}"
    k "{i}我得打个电话通知一下他们，我马上要回家了。只是还得先留在这个城市里一段时间，把剩下的生意上的事情先处理完。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:50
translate chinese ep3_978909f0:

    # k "{i}I bet they'll be ecstatic to know that I'm back in the country again. *giggles*{/i}"
    k "{i}他们要是知道我回国了肯定会非常高兴的。 *笑*{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:51
translate chinese ep3_cbbeaffe:

    # k "{i}Oh, right. I should fix something for dinner first.{/i}"
    k "{i}对了，我得先准备晚饭。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:53
translate chinese ep3_3755c2a6:

    # "*doorbell rings*"
    "*门铃声*"

# game/ep3.rpy:56
translate chinese ep3_0a044e43:

    # k "Hmn?"
    k "嗯？"

# game/ep3.rpy:64
translate chinese ep3_7356ee15:

    # k "Why if it isn't my dear Kana!"
    k "哎呀，这不是我亲爱的卡娜吗！"

# game/ep3.rpy:65
translate chinese ep3_d346a3ac:

    # ka "Good evening, aunt Klara!"
    ka "晚上好，克拉拉姨妈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:68
translate chinese ep3_aacea07e:

    # k "Oh, my... you look more like a real woman now!"
    k "瞧瞧……你现在看起来真是个成熟的女人了！"

# game/ep3.rpy:69
translate chinese ep3_780177ca:

    # k "Taking a good look at you, you really look like my sister. *giggles*"
    k "仔细看看，你跟我妹妹长得可真像。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:70
translate chinese ep3_35152e33:

    # ka "Like mother, like daughter, right?"
    ka "有其母必有其女嘛。"

# game/ep3.rpy:73
translate chinese ep3_5b516039:

    # ka "By the way, here are the documents that you asked me to bring."
    ka "对了，这是你之前让我带来的文件。"

# game/ep3.rpy:76
translate chinese ep3_a1752717:

    # k "Oh, gosh! Right! I told you to bring these to me here, didn't I? Thank you, dear!"
    k "哦！你一说我才想起来，确实是我让你带来的。谢谢你，亲爱的！"

# game/ep3.rpy:77
translate chinese ep3_1f3a0ec0:

    # k "...My~ I really am getting old, indeed!"
    k "……老天！我真是老了！"

# game/ep3.rpy:80
translate chinese ep3_08430880:

    # ka "Don't be too hard on yourself Auntie. And if you ask me, you don't look old at all!"
    ka "别给自己太大压力了，姨妈。而且要我说，你看起来一点也不老！"

# game/ep3.rpy:81
translate chinese ep3_4bdc94e7:

    # k "Aw... you're such a sweetheart, aren't you? Flattering me won't make me cook your favorite food, you know? *giggles*"
    k "啊……你可真是个乖孩子。就算你讨好我，我也不会给你做你最喜欢吃的饭菜的，知道吗？ *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:82
translate chinese ep3_8bd47c1d:

    # k "But since you're here and did me great favor... alright, I'll cook your favorite tonight."
    k "但既然你已经来了，还帮了我这么大的忙……我还是给你做你最喜欢吃的吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:83
translate chinese ep3_39d8a89f:

    # ka "Oh, yes~! I haven't tasted your food in years, Auntie!"
    ka "太棒啦~！姨妈，我都好几年没吃过你做的饭了！"

# game/ep3.rpy:84
translate chinese ep3_148df9a8:

    # k "Come and sit down on the sofa first, dear. I'll cook our dinner real quick."
    k "在沙发上坐会吧，亲爱的。晚饭很快就好。"

# game/ep3.rpy:85
translate chinese ep3_d1886489:

    # k "You're not in a hurry, are you?"
    k "你应该不急吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:86
translate chinese ep3_7ef7680d:

    # ka "No, just take your time, Auntie. *giggles*"
    ka "当然，你慢慢来就好，姨妈。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:124
translate chinese klaraherapause_726093b6:

    # "Meanwhile..."
    "与此同时……"

# game/ep3.rpy:133
translate chinese klaraherapause_7c2622d0:

    # mc "Uhm... why are you so shocked to see me? You're not doing anything fishy, are you?"
    mc "嗯……你看见我怎么这么大反应？该不会是在做什么可疑的事情吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:134
translate chinese klaraherapause_1b8e3191:

    # e "F-fishy? No. I'm just cooking for dinner... and..."
    e "可——可疑？没有。我只是在做晚饭……然后……"

# game/ep3.rpy:135
translate chinese klaraherapause_f43fb776:

    # e "{i}W-w-why does he have to come down here all of a sudden? Now of all times when I'm wearing this outfit!{/i}"
    e "{i}怎么办怎么办！他怎么突然就过来了？还是偏偏在我穿成这样的时候！{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:136
translate chinese klaraherapause_794951b4:

    # e "{i}I thought Sky was the one coming in here since she's the one usually cooking and all.{/i}"
    e "{i}平常都是斯凯做饭，我还以为下来的是她呢。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:139
translate chinese klaraherapause_8377d1d7:

    # e "{i}I-I have to compose myself.{/i}"
    e "{i}我——我得保持冷静。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:140
translate chinese klaraherapause_a13694f5:

    # yt "Here she is acting all strange again..."
    yt "她又变得特别奇怪了……"

# game/ep3.rpy:141
translate chinese klaraherapause_932eda72:

    # yt "...I really don't get her."
    yt "……真的搞不懂她。"

# game/ep3.rpy:142
translate chinese klaraherapause_96d59652:

    # e "*ahem*..."
    e "*咳嗽*..."

# game/ep3.rpy:143
translate chinese klaraherapause_dd8fbdcf:

    # yt "She cleared her throat?"
    yt "她是清了一下嗓子吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:146
translate chinese klaraherapause_98e11ef1:

    # e "*sighs*..."
    e "*叹气*..."

# game/ep3.rpy:147
translate chinese klaraherapause_a26436ef:

    # yt "A sigh?"
    yt "然后又叹气？"

# game/ep3.rpy:150
translate chinese klaraherapause_61ac9df5:

    # e "No, I'm just cooking for dinner. I won't poison you, so don't worry."
    e "没事，我只是在做晚饭而已。我不会下毒的，不用担心。"

# game/ep3.rpy:153
translate chinese klaraherapause_8031cb21:

    # mc "Are you sure about that...?"
    mc "你确定吗……？"

# game/ep3.rpy:154
translate chinese klaraherapause_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:157
translate chinese klaraherapause_eee37252:

    # mc "Hmm... But why are you wearing a maid outfit? This isn't a mansion, you know? We're just in a regular house on an ordinary city street."
    mc "嗯……那你为什么要穿女仆装？我家又不是什么古典大宅子。就是个普通房子而已。"

# game/ep3.rpy:166
translate chinese klaraherapause_308497eb:

    # e "I got used to it when we were still in the mansion and wore it out of habit."
    e "我还住在大宅子里的时候，因为爱好才穿这身衣服的，然后就养成了习惯。"

# game/ep3.rpy:167
translate chinese klaraherapause_0cfc562a:

    # e "I wear this all morning and at night. It's like my uniform."
    e "每天早上和晚上我都会穿。就好像我的工作服一样。"

# game/ep3.rpy:168
translate chinese klaraherapause_8b1e3921:

    # mc "...I can see why you got used to it."
    mc "……怪不得你穿习惯了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:171
translate chinese klaraherapause_1dc85c59:

    # mc "I must say, you look pretty good in it, Emma."
    mc "有一说一，你穿上还是很可爱的，艾玛。"

# game/ep3.rpy:172
translate chinese klaraherapause_0431c729:

    # mc "Although I still don't get why you were shocked to see me earlier."
    mc "虽然我还是想不通为什么你刚刚看见我之后那么惊讶。"

# game/ep3.rpy:176
translate chinese klaraherapause_0431c729_1:

    # mc "Although I still don't get why you were shocked to see me earlier."
    mc "虽然我还是想不通为什么你刚刚看见我之后那么惊讶。"

# game/ep3.rpy:178
translate chinese klaraherapause_cf3e57b6:

    # e "Because Aine and Freya are the only ones who've seen me wearing it. I'm not used to anybody but them seeing me in this outfit."
    e "因为只有艾妮和芙蕾雅见过我穿这身衣服的样子。除了她俩，我被谁看见都很不习惯。"

# game/ep3.rpy:179
translate chinese klaraherapause_a8c708f7:

    # mc "Not even Gwen?"
    mc "连格温也不行？"

# game/ep3.rpy:180
translate chinese klaraherapause_7f777308:

    # e "Not even Gwen."
    e "连格温也不行。"

# game/ep3.rpy:181
translate chinese klaraherapause_9098da49:

    # mc "Jeez..."
    mc "好吧……"

# game/ep3.rpy:182
translate chinese klaraherapause_e6e2095a:

    # mc "I still don't trust you cooking our dinner, though."
    mc "但我还是不敢吃你做的饭。"

# game/ep3.rpy:183
translate chinese klaraherapause_11cec388:

    # mc "You put laxatives on my lunch back in school, don't you remember?"
    mc "你以前可是往我的午餐盒里放过泻药，你应该没忘吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:184
translate chinese klaraherapause_4336d161:

    # mc "That sent me to the bathroom countless times that whole day, you psycho woman!"
    mc "那天我都快住在厕所里了，你个疯女人！"

# game/ep3.rpy:185
translate chinese klaraherapause_e1f1cecf:

    # e "I was just..."
    e "我只是……"

# game/ep3.rpy:188
translate chinese klaraherapause_cfcfe7ad:

    # e "{i}No... Even though Aine said she'll take all the blame... Still, my own actions are my own responsibility.{/i}"
    e "{i}即使艾妮说过她会背负一切……我也知道，我自己做过的事依然是我自己的责任。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:189
translate chinese klaraherapause_09ad4a74:

    # e "{i}I can't just let her shoulder everything.{/i}"
    e "{i}我不能让她自己一个人承担。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:198
translate chinese klaraherapause_9ab2be26:

    # e "Hey, uhm... I..."
    e "嗯，那个，我……"

# game/ep3.rpy:199
translate chinese klaraherapause_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "什么？"

# game/ep3.rpy:200
translate chinese klaraherapause_d583996b:

    # e "I'm sorry... for... hurting you before. Aine told me you guys had talked. And..."
    e "对不起……很抱歉……我之前伤害了你。艾妮告诉我你俩已经谈过了。然后……"

# game/ep3.rpy:201
translate chinese klaraherapause_af3c1509:

    # mc "Oh, boy..."
    mc "唉，又来了……"

# game/ep3.rpy:202
translate chinese klaraherapause_592d2bd6:

    # mc "*sighs* You know that I don't need that, right?"
    mc "*叹气* 你应该也知道我不需要你说这些吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:203
translate chinese klaraherapause_ffc5e0c3:

    # mc "Just like what I said to Aine, I don't need an apology. All I want is for you to show your sincerity through your actions."
    mc "我跟艾妮也说过了，我不需要你们道歉。我只想让你们通过行动来表达出悔过的诚意。"

# game/ep3.rpy:204
translate chinese klaraherapause_3b21f354:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep3.rpy:205
translate chinese klaraherapause_0a0b62d1:

    # mc ".........."
    mc "........."

# game/ep3.rpy:206
translate chinese klaraherapause_93d6e05a:

    # mc "You know what, Emma?"
    mc "这样吧，艾玛。"

# game/ep3.rpy:209
translate chinese klaraherapause_eaadd27b:

    # e "Hmn?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ep3.rpy:210
translate chinese klaraherapause_3b21f354_1:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep3.rpy:211
translate chinese klaraherapause_f3c7d1ee:

    # mc "No, never mind. Something just caught my mind for a moment."
    mc "算了算了。刚才突然想到了点东西。"

# game/ep3.rpy:214
translate chinese klaraherapause_1bdb3cfa:

    # mc "I must ask you though. Why didn't you tell me that Aine was being mistreated by her mother?"
    mc "但我得问问你。为什么你之前不告诉我艾妮一直被她妈妈虐待？"

# game/ep3.rpy:215
translate chinese klaraherapause_d5e6b706:

    # mc "Like, we had a pretty long conversation last time, but you never mentioned anything about it. Why is that?"
    mc "我们上次谈了那么久，但你一点也没提到。为什么？"

# game/ep3.rpy:216
translate chinese klaraherapause_8975eb9a:

    # e "The reason is simple."
    e "原因很简单。"

# game/ep3.rpy:217
translate chinese klaraherapause_5d4527a6:

    # e "...We are forbidden to talk to outsiders about Aine's mother, even if it's someone as important as a government official asking us to do so."
    e "……我们不能在跟外人的谈话里提到艾妮的母亲，哪怕是政府高层来问也不行。"

# game/ep3.rpy:218
translate chinese klaraherapause_1c3eefec:

    # e "I'm not even allowed to say her name."
    e "我连说她的名字都不被允许。"

# game/ep3.rpy:219
translate chinese klaraherapause_8af73f2b:

    # mc "Jesus Christ! Who does she think she is? The president of the country?"
    mc "老天爷啊！她以为自己很了不起吗？怎么，她是国家总统还是什么的？"

# game/ep3.rpy:220
