    # a "...Then, how old are you?"
    a "……那，你几岁了？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1332
translate chinese ainepause3_b9fb7e35:

    # a "{i}She's probably not older than [mc!t] and I, right?{/i}"
    a "{i}我觉得她可能比我和[mc!t]还大。{/i}"

# game/ep3.rpy:1333
translate chinese ainepause3_3a72367c:

    # n "That's easy. I'm 24, how 'bout you?"
    n "这很简单。我24岁了，你呢？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1336
translate chinese ainepause3_6e373fe8:

    # a "Really?!"
    a "真的吗？！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1337
translate chinese ainepause3_bb680ffd:

    # a "You're a year older than me! I'm 23, but I'm turning 24 this year though."
    a "你比我大一岁！我23岁，但是今年晚些时候就24岁了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1338
translate chinese ainepause3_650d34e2:

    # n "*giggle* What's with that reaction? Do I look older than my age?"
    n "*笑* 你这是什么反应？我看起来更老吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1341
translate chinese ainepause3_6e817f9e:

    # a "Oh, no, no! I didn't mean it like that. To be honest, it's the opposite. You look so young and pretty!"
    a "噢，不是，不是的！我不是那个意思！我是完全相反的意思！你看着又年轻又漂亮！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1342
translate chinese ainepause3_f2ed709e:

    # n "Why, thanks! You're quite a looker yourself. Hehe."
    n "多谢夸奖！你自己也是个小美女。嘿嘿。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1343
