    a "呃……也算不上啦……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1346
translate chinese ainepause3_38372425:

    # n "Not so confident, are we?"
    n "怎么没什么自信呢？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1347
translate chinese ainepause3_4b0abf3d:

    # n "That's what we always say when someone tells us that we are pretty. We may never look at ourselves like that, but to some people, we actually are."
    n "有人夸自己漂亮的时候，大多数时候我们都会那么说。可能在自己看来确实并不算好看，但在别人眼里就不一样了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1348
translate chinese ainepause3_79f6981b:

    # n "So chin up, 'cuz you're one hell of a neck turner. Hahaha!"
    n "所以精神点，你这模样上街，走在你前面的男人都要把脖子给扭断了。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1351
translate chinese ainepause3_72e1134d:

    # a "Well... hehe. Thanks, I guess. *giggles*"
    a "嗯……嘿嘿。谢谢你。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:1354
translate chinese ainepause3_698ae20e:

    # a "Do you live around here?"
    a "你住在附近吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1355
translate chinese ainepause3_64c64f0c:

    # n "I do now, but I used to live in the countryside. I spent a lot of years there. I moved here recently when dad had an accident and I had to take care of him."
    n "现在是住在这边，但以前我住在乡下。我在乡下待了很久。我爸前段时间出了点事，我得搬来照顾他。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1358
translate chinese ainepause3_372846a2:

    # a "Oh my... I'm sorry to hear that. What happened? Is he doing fine now?"
    a "天哪……我很抱歉。怎么了？他现在还好吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1359
translate chinese ainepause3_80ee25a3:

    # n "Heh... the silly old man fell down the stairs and broke a few bones, but he's alright now."
    n "呵……蠢老头儿从楼梯上摔下来了，断了好几根骨头，但现在差不多没事了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1360
translate chinese ainepause3_c170a564:

    # n "He's actually your usual repairman here. But I'm takin' over now since he's too old for the job, and the accident he had made it worse."
    n "一般都是他来你们家里修东西的。但是他现在老得干不动了，更别说又出了那么一档子事，以后就让我接班了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1361
translate chinese ainepause3_ebe784a9:

    # a "I see..."
    a "好吧……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1364
translate chinese ainepause3_9217e8fe:

    # n "If you have more questions, don't hesitate to ask, I'd be more than happy to answer them for you."
    n "你要是还有问题，都可以尽管问，我很愿意跟你聊的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1365
translate chinese ainepause3_906de7b9:

    # a "Yes, I have one last question..."
    a "嗯，我还有最后一个问题……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1366
translate chinese ainepause3_68971a0d:

    # a "Uhm..."
    a "呃……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1369
translate chinese ainepause3_51b5c735:

    # a "Are you and [mc!t]..."
    a "你跟[mc!t]……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1370
translate chinese ainepause3_848bd3aa:

    # a "I mean... are you guys dating?"
    a "你俩……是在谈恋爱吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1371
translate chinese ainepause3_1670ad30:

    # n "Hmn? What makes ya say that?"
    n "啊？你咋会这么想呢？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1372
translate chinese ainepause3_960c3eb1:

    # a "Hmm... I was just looking at you two earlier, and I somehow felt something... but, I don't know..."
    a "嗯……我刚才看你俩站在一块，然后我就感觉……哎呀，怎么说呢……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1373
translate chinese ainepause3_9def722d:

    # n "D'ya like him?"
    n "你喜欢他啊？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1376
translate chinese ainepause3_82e4de72:

    # a "Eh? No, no, no! It's nothing like that!"
    a "啊？不不不！根本不是那样的！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1379
translate chinese ainepause3_c21bb3c0:

    # n "Relax... we're not datin' or anythin'. In fact, we never met each other until just earlier, so rest easy. *giggles*"
    n "冷静点……我们咋可能在谈恋爱。我就刚刚才第一次见到他这个人，你就放宽心吧。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:1380
translate chinese ainepause3_ed6d2220:

    # a "Oh, I'm really sorry. I just assumed that out of nowhere."
    a "噢，真的很对不起。我不知道怎么地就把你俩……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1381
translate chinese ainepause3_ab62f7f9:

    # a "You two look great together though."
    a "不过你俩看着确实很配。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1382
translate chinese ainepause3_cbb09cf0:

    # n "Havin' a commitment, is the last thing I need right now."
    n "我现在最不需要的，就是谈恋爱。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1383
translate chinese ainepause3_97153c04:

    # n "I'm not sayin' this in general, but most guys just want the same thing. They approach and date you for that reason."
    n "我不是开地图炮，但是大多数男人想要的东西都是一样的。他们都为了那么一个东西，跑过来说爱你。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1384
translate chinese ainepause3_69786990:

    # n "But once they get what they want and get sick and tired of it, they'll all leave you in the end."
    n "一旦拿到手了，很快就腻了，最后只剩下你一个人。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1385
translate chinese ainepause3_316f6419:

    # n "At least, that's what I have seen and heard in most cases. But like I said, I'm not sayin' all guys are like that."
    n "至少，我自己亲眼看见过的，还有我听说过的，基本都是这种情况。但我也说了，我不是说所有男人都是那样的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1386
translate chinese ainepause3_2f2f8b76:

    # n "I admit that there are sincere gentlemen out there. Let's say that [mc!t] is one of them, but that doesn't mean that he's stayin' like that forever, wouldn't you say?"
    n "我承认世界上确实有好男人。就假设[mc!t]也是个好男人，但那也不代表他一辈子都不会变，你说呢？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1387
translate chinese ainepause3_2c991fef:

    # a "You make a fair point..."
    a "你说得挺对的……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1390
translate chinese ainepause3_31cf2cc0:

    # a "...But, with all the things I've done in the past... I don't know... if I still deserve any attention from anyone."
    a "……但是，我过去做过那种事情……我不知道……我还配不配得到别人的关心。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1391
translate chinese ainepause3_8c3c639d:

    # n "Hmn? What do you mean by that?"
    n "嗯？你这话是什么意思？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1394
translate chinese ainepause3_8c7c5217:

    # a "Oh... hehe... never mind that. I was just speaking my mind for a moment."
    a "噢……嘿嘿……没事。我在自言自语。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1395
translate chinese ainepause3_41df7470:

    # n "......"
    n "......"

# game/ep3.rpy:1396
translate chinese ainepause3_6c299708:

    # n "...Let me ask you a question then."
    n "……那我也问你一个问题。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1397
translate chinese ainepause3_7b43b4e4:

    # a "Sure! It's not fair that I'm just asking you, is it? Hehe."
    a "好啊！毕竟光我问你就不公平了，嘿嘿。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1398
translate chinese ainepause3_6d91ffc1:

    # n "...I don't know what you did in the past. And I don't wanna dig into the life of someone I just met..."
    n "……我不知道你过去干过些什么。我也不想打听我刚认识的人的隐私……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1399
translate chinese ainepause3_5941af43:

    # n "But, do you regret what you've done? You don't have to answer my question if you don't want to."
    n "但是，你后悔你做过的事吗？当然，你要是不想回答的话，不用回答我也可以。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1402
translate chinese ainepause3_732a8756_1:

    # a "......"
    a "......"

# game/ep3.rpy:1403
translate chinese ainepause3_bf4d428b:

    # a "...Yes, I deeply regret everything..."
    a "……是的，我对我做过的一切都感到无尽的后悔……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1404
translate chinese ainepause3_aeee5fea:

    # n "Then that's all that matters, mate. Imbeciles may say you don't deserve any forgiveness, that you deserved to be punished or you belong in hell."
    n "这就够了，伙计。也许会有蠢蛋说你不配被原谅，必须受到惩罚，或者该下地狱那些的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1405
translate chinese ainepause3_2c82705e:

    # n "Don't listen to those folks, everyone deserves a chance to be forgiven. Even criminals are given a second chance."
    n "不要听那些人的，每个人都有被原谅的资格。就连罪犯也会有第二次机会。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1408
translate chinese ainepause3_99f87ebd:

    # n "The past stays in the past, Aine. Move on, and strive to be a better individual, then do good things from now on."
    n "过去的就留在过去吧，艾妮。向前看，努力做一个更好的人。从现在开始做好事。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1409
translate chinese ainepause3_310e6179:

    # a "Thanks for saying that, Naomi. That makes me feel a bit better."
    a "谢谢你那么说，娜奥米。我感觉好点了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1412
translate chinese ainepause3_fdc64c71:

    # n "No worries. Now, the faucet should be workin' properly. I found out the filter was just clogged up by accumulated dirt, so it wasn't that hard to fix."
    n "没关系。水龙头也已经修好了。只是过滤器被积灰堵住了，很容易修好的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1413
translate chinese ainepause3_9e304be4:

    # a "You're amazing, Naomi! Do you fix other things too?"
    a "你真厉害，娜奥米！你还会修其他东西吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1414
translate chinese ainepause3_57520e04:

    # n "Not everythin', but almost. If ya have problems with anything, just call me and I'll try to get it done for ya."
    n "也不是什么都会修吧，但是大部分都懂一点。要是你们遇到什么问题，给我打电话就好了，我可以过来给你们看看。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1415
translate chinese ainepause3_81df9793:

    # n "Just don't call me if 'tis your heart that's broken. 'Cuz I can't help ya with anything in that regard. Haha!"
    n "但要是像“哎呀人家分手了好伤心哦”这种情况就别找我了，我没法提供感情咨询。哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1416
translate chinese ainepause3_eb858cd2:

    # a "*giggles* You silly! But hey, that was a pretty good statement earlier, so you might know a lot of things."
    a "*笑* 瞎说什么呀！但你刚刚说什么都懂点还让我挺意外的，我感觉你很厉害。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1417
translate chinese ainepause3_0a90895a:

    # n "I know a thing or two, but I'm not that experienced when it comes to relationships. Hehehe!"
    n "我是多少都懂点，但是感情问题我就没什么经验了。嘿嘿嘿！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1418
translate chinese ainepause3_bd46f085:

    # n "Now I will go, or I'll be late for my next stop."
    n "好了，我该走了，还得赶去下一家呢。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1419
translate chinese ainepause3_95bc1762:

    # a "Oh, alright then, let me walk you out."
    a "噢，好的，我送你去门口吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1420
translate chinese ainepause3_f53d5a22_1:

    # n "Cheers!"
    n "谢了！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1428
translate chinese ainepause3_f875baed:

    # n "It's goodbye for now. But, I'll be back here early tomorrow mornin'."
    n "现在就先再见了。但是明天早上我会再回来的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1431
translate chinese ainepause3_b550650e:

    # a "Sure thing! I'm looking forward to talking to you again. You've been really nice! Hehe!"
    a "好的！我等不及继续跟你聊天了。你人真的很好！嘿嘿！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1433
translate chinese ainepause3_15f52065_1:

    # "*door opens*"
    "*开门*"

# game/ep3.rpy:1437
translate chinese ainepause3_cace0d8e:

    # "*door closed*"
    "*关门*"

# game/ep3.rpy:1440
translate chinese ainepause3_88c345aa:

    # a "Hey there, [mc!t]."
    a "你好啊，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1441
translate chinese ainepause3_1b30788c:

    # mc "Oh, are you guys done? Sorry I couldn't check on you guys earlier."
    mc "噢，你们弄完了吗？不好意思，刚才我没时间去你俩那看看情况。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1442
translate chinese ainepause3_d7ad7db1:

    # n "It's all good, no worries. The faucet's all fixed. However, I still have to come back here tomorrow mornin' for the kitchen sink."
    n "都解决了，不用担心。水龙头已经修好了。但是，我得明天早上再回来修厨房的水槽。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1443
translate chinese ainepause3_4e498532:

    # n "I haven't brought the right tools for it. Silly dad for not informin' me about the whole issue."
    n "我没带合适的工具。我那傻老爸根本就没跟我说厨房的事。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1444
translate chinese ainepause3_4667b635:

    # n "I just hope your sink can hold on till then. Haha!"
    n "希望水槽还能撑到明天。哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1445
translate chinese ainepause3_7c0b817a:

    # mc "Well then, I guess we'll have to use the bathroom sink for now. Hahaha!"
    mc "好吧，那只能先用厕所的凑合一下了。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1446
translate chinese ainepause3_c5c6ab9c:

    # n "I wouldn't do that if I were you. *giggles*"
    n "我可不建议你那么干。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:1447
translate chinese ainepause3_7e369e3d:

    # mc "Nah... I'm just kidding."
    mc "哈哈……开个玩笑。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1449
translate chinese ainepause3_51ee6c29:

    # n "Thanks for turnin' off the water valve for me, by the way."
    n "对了，谢谢你之前去帮我关主水阀。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1450
translate chinese ainepause3_5617647b:

    # mc "Oh, hehe. You're welcome!"
    mc "噢，嘿嘿。不用谢！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1451
translate chinese ainepause3_8370ec8c:

    # n "Are ya goin' to work now?"
    n "你要去上班吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1452
translate chinese ainepause3_210e6b55:

    # mc "Yep! Why do you ask?"
    mc "是的！怎么了？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1453
translate chinese ainepause3_ae843cdc:

    # n "Why don't ya just come with me? I'll drop ya off, instead."
    n "要不你坐我的车吧？我送你。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1457
translate chinese ainepause3_40bac98a:

    # mc "Nah... I really don't want to impose. Plus, the place where I work is just walking distance from here."
    mc "算了吧……我不想打扰你。而且，我上班的地方稍微走一会儿就到了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1458
translate chinese ainepause3_982cdcbd:

    # n "Are ya sure?"
    n "确定吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1459
translate chinese ainepause3_e9b52771:

    # mc "Yeah! Don't worry about me."
    mc "嗯！不用担心。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1460
translate chinese ainepause3_cd25f98f:

    # n "Alright then, I'm gonna head out now. I'll see you both tomorrow."
    n "好吧，那我先走了。明天见。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1461
translate chinese ainepause3_28a7dbae:

    # mc "Take care, Naomi."
    mc "一路顺风，娜奥米。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1462
translate chinese ainepause3_0428a793:

    # n "Cheers! Ya do the same."
    n "谢谢！你也一样。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1465
translate chinese ainepause3_95150a69:

    # mc "I'm going now too, Aine. I'll see you later."
    mc "我也要走了，艾妮。待会见。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1468
translate chinese ainepause3_9fc60531:

    # a "Ah..."
    a "啊……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1471
translate chinese ainepause3_c99e9da7:

    # a "Mmn......"
    a "嗯……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1474
translate chinese ainepause3_22dbe507:

    # mc "Hehe. Sure, thanks for having me."
    mc "嘿嘿。好啊，谢谢你送我。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1475
translate chinese ainepause3_946695cc:

    # n "Alright then, let's go?"
    n "好嘞，那走吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1476
translate chinese ainepause3_a3ef5b48:

    # mc "Okay!"
    mc "OK！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1479
translate chinese ainepause3_123cf508:

    # mc "We're going now, Aine. I'll see you later."
    mc "我们要走了，艾妮。待会见。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1482
translate chinese ainepause3_9fc60531_1:

    # a "Ah..."
    a "啊……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1485
translate chinese ainepause3_c99e9da7_1:

    # a "Mmn......"
    a "嗯……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1494
translate chinese ainepause3_748f1ca6:

    # mc "Holy... crap, Naomi!"
    mc "我去……娜奥米！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1495
translate chinese ainepause3_166a3532:

    # mc "Is this yours?!"
    mc "这车是你的吗？！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1496
translate chinese ainepause3_a0663014:

    # n "Haha! Not a single part of it."
    n "哈哈！连一个螺丝都不是我的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1497
translate chinese ainepause3_226b5ad2:

    # n "It's dad's. I just borrowed it so I could get to yer house as fast as I could."
    n "是我爸的。我为了路上方便借来开开。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1500
translate chinese ainepause3_4070036a:

    # mc "Damn! Mr. Scott rocks on this one!"
    mc "炫啊！没想到斯考特先生开这种车！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1501
translate chinese ainepause3_b9a2ff7a:

    # mc "Though I must say..."
    mc "不过我得说……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1504
translate chinese ainepause3_6e53011c:

    # mc "...it really suits your style somehow."
    mc "……这车跟你的气质还蛮搭的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1505
translate chinese ainepause3_86c74ac3:

    # n "Haha! Dad told me the same. He wanted to give it to me when I got my driver's license, but he changed his mind."
    n "哈哈！我爸也这么说的。他本来想着等我有了驾照就把车送我，但后来又反悔了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1506
translate chinese ainepause3_d667f790:

    # n "I guess he doesn't want to let go of his partner just yet."
    n "估计他暂时还舍不得这么一个大宝贝。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1507
translate chinese ainepause3_c05c264e:

    # n "Silly old man. Hahaha!"
    n "傻老头。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1509
translate chinese ainepause3_d90b3963:

    # mc "...you'd look way better in a smaller car."
    mc "……你还是开辆小一点的车会更合适。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1510
translate chinese ainepause3_dddcc6e1:

    # mc "It's just my opinion though, I'm not really judging."
    mc "但只是我的个人意见，没有别的意思。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1511
translate chinese ainepause3_d669cb6c:

    # n "Ya think so?"
    n "你真这么觉得吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1512
translate chinese ainepause3_e9a28e46:

    # mc "Yeah!"
    mc "对啊！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1513
translate chinese ainepause3_1022ca1a:

    # n "Dad actually told me that it suits me really well. He wanted to give it to me when I got my driver's license, but he changed his mind."
    n "我爸其实说这车还挺适合我的。他本来想着等我有了驾照就把车送我，但后来又反悔了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1514
translate chinese ainepause3_d37e6906:

    # n "I guess he doesn't wanna let go of his partner just yet."
    n "估计他暂时还舍不得这么一个大宝贝。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1515
translate chinese ainepause3_c05c264e_1:

    # n "Silly old man. Hahaha!"
    n "傻老头。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1519
translate chinese ainepause3_03ae2f47:

    # mc "Now that we talked about him..."
    mc "说到他……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1520
translate chinese ainepause3_4847e0c0:

    # mc "He told me he fell down the stairs and... *sighs*"
    mc "他跟我说他从楼梯下摔下来了，然后…… *叹气*"

# game/ep3.rpy:1521
translate chinese ainepause3_7f32ff15:

    # mc "...broke a few bones..."
    mc "……摔断了好几根骨头……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1522
translate chinese ainepause3_ebde493c:

    # mc "Is he going to be alright? I mean... he told me that he's fine. But I know that he just told me that to make me feel better."
    mc "他没事吧？虽然他跟我说他没事……但我知道他肯定是不想让我担心。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1531
translate chinese ainepause3_69a28f99:

    # n "I heard ya guys talk over the phone. If he tells ya that he's fine, he'll be fine. He'll never lie 'bout things such as his health condition."
    n "你俩打电话的时候我都听见了。如果他跟你说他没事，那他肯定真的没事。他是不会在身体状况这种事上骗人的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1532
translate chinese ainepause3_3539e5d2:

    # n "He's a man of his word, so just trust him."
    n "他向来说话算数，相信他就好了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1533
translate chinese ainepause3_8e64bc71:

    # mc "Yeah, I guess so..."
    mc "好吧，我知道了……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1534
translate chinese ainepause3_1e37af7f:

    # mc "In any case, I told him that I'll visit him. So I will, once I have time. Is it fine if I come over on the weekend?"
    mc "总之，我跟他说了，我会去看他。所以有时间的话我就会去的。我周末的时候可以去你家吗？"

