    # n "Of course! I don't see why not? It'll be our pleasure to have ya around. Dad seems to really like ya after all."
    n "当然可以！怎么会不行呢？你能来我俩都会很开心的。我爸好像很喜欢你。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1536
