    n "不用客气！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1546
translate chinese ainepause3_2495f9d4:

    # n "...Oh, by the way, I have been driving for a while, but I don't know where to drop ya off."
    n "……哦对了，我开了这么一会儿，还不知道你在哪下呢。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1547
translate chinese ainepause3_43fdd18e:

    # mc "Right, I almost forgot! Please drop me off at 'Woody Burger'. It's near the central plaza."
    mc "哦，我也差点忘了！把我送到“胡迪汉堡”就好。在中央广场附近。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1548
translate chinese ainepause3_68b0db2c:

    # n "I gotcha!"
    n "收到！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1551
translate chinese ainepause3_a1c72960:

    # mc "Uhm... is it alright if I ask you some questions?"
    mc "嗯……我能问你几个问题吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1552
translate chinese ainepause3_db7f339b:

    # mc "But it's alright if you don't want me to, I don't want to bother you that much since you're driving."
    mc "但你拒绝也没关系，毕竟你在开车，我不想让你分心。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1553
translate chinese ainepause3_17606e9c:

    # n "Sure, just ask away! I don't see it as a problem, really."
    n "当然可以，随便问吧！我不在意的，没事。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1554
translate chinese ainepause3_975656ff:

    # mc "Okay. Then..."
    mc "OK。那……"

# game/ep3.rpy:1559
translate chinese naomiquestions_a832aca7:

    # mc "Is this your regular everyday job? I mean, it's not really a typical job a woman would take, you know?"
    mc "你以后就干这一行了吗？我意思是，女人一般不会干修理这种的工作，对吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1560
translate chinese naomiquestions_85662868:

    # n "Yes it is! To be really honest with ya, I don't just fix things inside the house like what I did earlier. It could be anythin'."
    n "我的确是干修理的！说实话，我不止会去修房子里的器件之类的。我什么都能干。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1561
translate chinese naomiquestions_d79d1a1e:

    # n "Electronics, automotive, house maintenance and a lot o' things! However, I do specialize in automobiles."
    n "电子设备，汽车，房屋维护，还有一大堆其他的！不过呢，我最擅长的还是汽车。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1562
translate chinese naomiquestions_2a953549:

    # mc "Whoa! That's a lot! So you're basically a Handyman? Or should I say, a Handywoman? Hahaha!"
    mc "哇！你会这么多！所以你算是个万事屋吗？哈哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1563
translate chinese naomiquestions_f5e01f4e:

    # n "Yep! That's me! Haha."
    n "嗯呢！就是我！哈哈。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1564
translate chinese naomiquestions_2a20891c:

    # mc "That's really impressive if I really think about it! Did you learn all of it from Mr. Scott?"
    mc "仔细想想，你真的很厉害啊！都是从斯考特先生那学来的吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1565
translate chinese naomiquestions_b65534d9:

    # n "Yes, I did. However, there are some things that I learned on my own. Like mobile phones and computers for example."
    n "是的，基本都是他教的。但还是有些东西是我自己学的。比如说跟手机和电脑有关的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1566
translate chinese naomiquestions_d1812922:

    # n "Dad is an electrician, but he doesn't have any knowledge about gadgets and stuff."
    n "我爸虽然是个电工，但是对那种东西完全不懂。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1567
translate chinese naomiquestions_35a9ae14:

    # n "And I may specialize in automotive which I picked up from dad, but I majored in Electronics when I was in college."
    n "我跟我爸学了很多修车的本事，但我大学里学的是电子工程。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1568
translate chinese naomiquestions_8d672b1f:

    # mc "That explains it, yes. But did you really want this job from the beginning?"
    mc "原来是这样。但你一开始就想接你爸的班吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1569
translate chinese naomiquestions_019493dd:

    # n "It's not that great of a job, but I would say... it was my dream."
    n "这也算不上什么特别牛的工作，但我觉得……这是我的梦想。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1570
translate chinese naomiquestions_1adf2c64:

    # n "I watched dad do things here and there when I was little, and I said to myself, 'that's how I wanna be!'. *giggles*"
    n "我小时候就经常看我爸这里敲敲，那里砸砸，然后我就想，“我长大了也要这样！”。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:1571
translate chinese naomiquestions_5e8f15e1:

    # mc "What do you mean 'not that great'? Are you kidding me? That's a lot of things to master, you know?"
    mc "你怎么能说不是特别牛呢？你在开玩笑吧？明明要学那么多东西呢！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1572
translate chinese naomiquestions_577a9951:

    # mc "I would have a hard time doing so if I was in your place."
    mc "要是换我的话，我肯定没法像你那样。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1573
translate chinese naomiquestions_c60898f3:

    # n "Well, we all have our own field of specialization, and I assume that ya do, am I right?"
    n "嗯，大家各有所长嘛。我猜你也有你的专业领域，对吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1574
translate chinese naomiquestions_58b5b057:

    # mc "Aside from customer service and cooking burgers? Yes I do. Haha!"
    mc "除了服务客人还有做汉堡之外吗？我确实还有。哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1575
translate chinese naomiquestions_e6459d87:

    # mc "I took up Information Technology and specialized as a Systems Analyst. So I'm kinda good with some technical stuff."
    mc "我大学里学的是IT，就业志向是系统分析师。所以我对技术类的东西还挺擅长的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1576
translate chinese naomiquestions_3ed08dc3:

    # n "Ooh... that's quite a complicated career path you got there. I'm not shamin' ya, but how come ya work in a burger shack though?"
    n "噢……你学的东西还蛮复杂的。我没有别的意思，但是你现在怎么在汉堡店里上班呢？"

# game/ep3.rpy:1577
translate chinese naomiquestions_bd13b19f:

    # mc "They say the job is pretty in demand, but I don't think so."
    mc "都说这种工作很好就业，但是我一点也不觉得。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1578
translate chinese naomiquestions_df8b95f8:

    # mc "I ended up working in a burger shack instead because I had trouble finding job vacancies."
    mc "我一直找不到合适的工作，最后才去汉堡店的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1579
translate chinese naomiquestions_fbec6fb1:

    # mc "There may have been some, but they're looking for some experience from you, which I don't have since I was a fresh grad."
    mc "所有公司都只要有经验的人，我那时候刚刚毕业，怎么可能有经验呢。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1580
translate chinese naomiquestions_9d82de88:

    # n "Then how 'bout now? There might be some companies that are willing to accept inexperienced applicants, ya know?"
    n "那现在呢？现在说不定会有公司招没有经验的新人。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1581
translate chinese naomiquestions_071de208:

    # mc "I don't know to be honest... I grew pretty close to the burger shack now. I can't resign just like that."
    mc "说实话我不知道该怎么办……我现在对汉堡店挺有感情了。我不想随便就辞职。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1582
