# game/ep3.rpy:1589
translate chinese naomiquestions_78a39e00:

    # n "No, just moved in a few weeks ago when dad had his accident, and I had to take care of him."
    n "不是的，他前几个星期出了事之后我才搬过来的，毕竟得有人照顾他。"

