# game/ep3.rpy:12
translate chinese ep3_12a7a072:

    # k "My husband died because of you!"
    k "我的丈夫因为你才死的！"

# game/ep3.rpy:13
translate chinese ep3_b7dd2c50:

    # k "You used your own daughter to make my [tenant!t] suffer because you couldn't move on with what happened to us in the past..."
    k "而且就因为你放不下过去的事情，你还利用你女儿让我[tenant!t]受苦……"

# game/ep3.rpy:20
translate chinese ep3_b7509dfa:

    # k "Stole? Sttole you say?"
    k "抢？你说我把他抢走了？"

# game/ep3.rpy:21
translate chinese ep3_aaf0df38:

    # k "He chose me instead of you. I did nothing to take his attention away from you, Hera."
    k "他只是选了我，而不是你而已。我根本没做任何把他抢过来的事，赫拉。"

# game/ep3.rpy:22
translate chinese ep3_be0f1fd7:

    # k "Enough is enough."
    k "够了，真的够了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:23
translate chinese ep3_47872d74:

    # k "One more move from you, and this won't stay between just you and me anymore."
    k "你再敢出手，那就不只是咱们两个人之间的恩怨了，赫拉。"

# game/ep3.rpy:26
translate chinese ep3_a322a735:

    # h "Hmp... What can you do? Report me to the authorities?"
    h "呵……你能怎么办？向警察告发我？"

# game/ep3.rpy:27
translate chinese ep3_a9a1183b:

    # h "I can control the law, Klara."
    h "我连法律都可以掌控，克拉拉。"

# game/ep3.rpy:28
translate chinese ep3_86f4bb1e:

    # h "And I know what you've been doing all this time. I know for a fact that my daughter is staying with your [tenant!t] right now."
    h "我知道你一直以来都在干些什么。我也知道我女儿现在和你[tenant!t]住在一起。"

# game/ep3.rpy:29
translate chinese ep3_25387eaa:

    # h "I know what you are planning. You're just as dirty as I am. *chuckles*"
    h "我知道你在计划什么。你跟我一样肮脏下作。 *笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:31
translate chinese ep3_b5ee18f1:

    # k "I may not have told my [tenant!t] about it, and that's selfish of me, I know."
    k "我没有把事情告诉我[tenant!t]，这很自私，我知道。"

# game/ep3.rpy:32
translate chinese ep3_893a01db:

    # k "But all I want is for them to understand and forgive each other."
    k "但我只想让他们互相和解、互相原谅。"

# game/ep3.rpy:85
translate chinese ep3_0db1b0c4:

    # ka "Don't be too hard on yourself, Auntie. And if you ask me, you don't look old at all!"
    ka "别给自己太大压力了，姨妈。而且要我说，你看起来一点也不老！"

# game/ep3.rpy:87
translate chinese ep3_35fab766:

    # k "But since did me great favor... alright, I'll reconsider."
    k "但既然你帮了我这么大的忙……我就重新考虑一下吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:162
translate chinese klaraherapause_d937dacc:

    # mc "Hmm... But why are you wearing a maid outfit? This isn't a mansion, you know?"
    mc "嗯……那你为什么要穿女仆装？我家又不是什么古典大宅子。"

# game/ep3.rpy:163
translate chinese klaraherapause_9e5e204f:

    # mc "We're just in a regular house on an ordinary city street."
    mc "就是个普通房子而已。"

# game/ep3.rpy:297
translate chinese klaraherapause_77ee7366:

    # s "Huh?"
    s "嗯？"

# game/ep3.rpy:302
translate chinese klaraherapause_e05e49ac:

    # ka "[mc!t]~! Sky~! How are you guys? Heheee~!"
    ka "[mc!t]~！斯凯~！最近还好吗？嘿嘿~！"

# game/ep3.rpy:311
translate chinese klaraherapause_424c4d5f:

    # ka "I don't know. I guess puberty wasn't over for me yet."
    ka "我也不知道。可能我的青春期还没结束吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:312
translate chinese klaraherapause_4be7abc4:

    # ka "And I did not really change that much, if you ask me."
    ka "而且要我说，我的变化也没那么大吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:313
translate chinese klaraherapause_cd57a0d9:

    # ka "Anyway, I'm hoping we can meet up soon! How about we go camping somewhere? Sounds exciting, right?"
    ka "总之，我也希望我们能早点见面！到时候一起出去野营怎么样？应该是个好主意吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:319
translate chinese klaraherapause_df2d03f4:

    # k "*chuckles*"
    k "*笑*"

# game/ep3.rpy:326
translate chinese klaraherapause_c75c7e7d:

    # s "Back hooome?!!"
    s "回家了~~？！！"

# game/ep3.rpy:330
translate chinese klaraherapause_689ea5ed:

    # ka "I sure had my fair share of stupidity before, but I wasn't expecting you guys to be so dense. Ahaha!"
    ka "我以前确实也不聪明，但没想到你俩也这么笨啊。啊哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:332
translate chinese klaraherapause_e3ccc322:

    # k "Alright, alright... you guys should calm down before it gets out of hand."
    k "好啦好啦……你们几个别闹了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:333
translate chinese klaraherapause_00dddc78:

    # k "Nothing has changed whenever you guys talk or meet each other."
    k "你们呀，一聚到一起就没法消停。"

# game/ep3.rpy:336
translate chinese klaraherapause_debf0075:

    # k "Yes, I'm back in the country. But I won't be home just yet."
    k "是的，我确实回国了。但现在还没法回家。"

# game/ep3.rpy:337
translate chinese klaraherapause_90104e84:

    # k "I still have something to take care of in this city for a couple of weeks."
    k "我得先在目前这个地方待几个星期，把一些事情处理完。"

# game/ep3.rpy:343
translate chinese klaraherapause_dc1cd401_1:

    # s "Hm?"
    s "嗯？"

# game/ep3.rpy:347
translate chinese klaraherapause_f127926b:

    # ka "Yep!"
    ka "没错！"

# game/ep3.rpy:351
translate chinese klaraherapause_1253ef3b:

    # k "Yes, my dear! However, we need to process some papers here first."
    k "是呀，宝贝！但是，我们得先在这边处理一些文件工作。"

# game/ep3.rpy:352
translate chinese klaraherapause_14781c7d:

    # k "That is why I couldn't come home just yet. But I will, once all matters have been taken care of."
    k "所以我才不能马上回家。但事情都解决完之后我会立马回去的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:363
translate chinese klaraherapause_2e61995a:

    # k "Yet, that is. But with you as my partner, I agree with [mc!t] that everything will lead to success."
    k "只是暂时的。有你协助，我觉得[mc!t]说得很对，我们一定会成功的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:364
translate chinese klaraherapause_ccd1371e:

    # k "That's why I chose you, and I'm glad that you accepted my request."
    k "所以我才选了你来帮我，也很感谢你愿意答应我的请求。"

# game/ep3.rpy:374
translate chinese klaraherapause_2e61995a_1:

    # k "Yet, that is. But with you as my partner, I agree with [mc!t] that everything will lead to success."
    k "只是暂时的。有你协助，我觉得[mc!t]说得很对，我们一定会成功的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:375
translate chinese klaraherapause_df80c95f:

    # "That's why I chose you, and I'm glad that you accepted my request."
    k "所以我才选了你来帮我，也很感谢你愿意答应我的请求。"

# game/ep3.rpy:418
translate chinese klaraherapause_285a3d73:

    # mc "Don't worry about it for now, Sky."
    mc "现在就不要多想了，斯凯。"

# game/ep3.rpy:419
translate chinese klaraherapause_1c794ec6:

    # mc "It will be a challenge for both of us since we chose this kind of relationship, but I think [landlady!t] will understand us."
    mc "既然我们选择了这条禁忌的路，那就必须面对挑战，但是我觉得[landlady!t]会理解我们的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:435
translate chinese klaraherapause_f0c860a7:

    # s "Yep! Hehe! Let's go."
    s "嗯！嘿嘿！走吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:440
translate chinese klaraherapause_f0c860a7_1:

    # s "Yep! Hehe! Let's go."
    s "嗯！嘿嘿！走吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:510
translate chinese klaraherapause_ab718ad0:

    # mc "...Well, I don't wanna push you into something."
    mc "……怎么说呢，倒也不是我想多管你的闲事。"

# game/ep3.rpy:511
translate chinese klaraherapause_8dee7870:

    # mc "But I'd rather have you drink till you pass out. Way better than cutting your potential years of living with cigarettes."
    mc "但我倒宁愿你喝个大醉。总比天天吸烟，让自己短命来的要好。"

# game/ep3.rpy:521
translate chinese klaraherapause_823dda8d:

    # g "That's what I like about you. You're soft-hearted, kind, and somehow care about me even though we weren't {b}that{/b} close before."
    g "我就是喜欢你这点。你心肠软，善良，哪怕咱俩之前关系没有{b}那么{/b}好，你也还关心我。"

# game/ep3.rpy:522
translate chinese klaraherapause_4d3925d9:

    # g "Well, I didn't really do anything to you before aside from making you buy wine for me..."
    g "不过呢，以前我除了让你给我买酒，倒也没对你做过其他事情……"

# game/ep3.rpy:523
translate chinese klaraherapause_26dc80f9:

    # g "But still, sorry for being such a bitch..."
    g "尽管如此，我还是要向你道歉，我以前不该那样的……"

# game/ep3.rpy:526
translate chinese klaraherapause_6ea3d98e:

    # g "Oh, oh~!"
    g "对了对了~！"

# game/ep3.rpy:527
translate chinese klaraherapause_213cf58a:

    # g "Remember the time when I let you taste alcohol for the first time?"
    g "还记得我让你喝点酒尝尝那次吗？"

# game/ep3.rpy:529
translate chinese klaraherapause_b438aad0:

    # mc "Well, that was the first time I tasted it. And it tasted gross! Haha!"
    mc "嗯，那次是我第一次喝酒。而且味道真的很糟糕！哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:530
translate chinese klaraherapause_eeff1163:

    # mc "I was also curious how it tasted anyway."
    mc "我纯粹是因为好奇才喝的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:537
translate chinese klaraherapause_4e896c41:

    # g "Yeah, about that..."
    g "是啊，说到这个……"

# game/ep3.rpy:539
translate chinese klaraherapause_94079f04:

    # g "I don't really think it's a bad thing, but you welcomed us just like that."
    g "并不是说那样不好，只是你一句话都没说，就让我们住进来了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:541
translate chinese klaraherapause_d400ac7d:

    # g "You know what I mean?"
    g "你懂我的意思吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:548
translate chinese klaraherapause_fb1ceff7:

    # g "Haha! What can Emma help you with anyway. She even has her own problems with communicating."
    g "哈哈！艾玛又能帮你什么呢。她自己跟人交流都有些困难。"

# game/ep3.rpy:559
translate chinese klaraherapause_d3f54071:

    # g "It doesn't feel right that you're telling me all this. But, one thing I can say..."
    g "你跟我说这些还挺奇怪的。但是，我可以跟你说一件事……"

# game/ep3.rpy:562
translate chinese klaraherapause_93c4414d:

    # g "Don't let it go to your head too much or it'll only make you stupid."
    g "别想太多这些东西，不然只会变傻的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:565
translate chinese klaraherapause_360388e5:

    # g "But what's even stupid is to have that coming from me who couldn't even set her own life straight."
    g "不过让像我这样连自己的生活都一团糟的人跟你说这些，倒也更傻。"

# game/ep3.rpy:567
translate chinese klaraherapause_142b6691:

    # g "You shouldn't worry about me."
    g "你就不用担心我了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:597
translate chinese klaraherapause_1074530b:

    # g "I remember you being so squishy back then. Ahahaha!"
    g "我还记得你以前经常全身黏糊糊的。哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ep3.rpy:601
translate chinese klaraherapause_a4fc48c5:

    # mc "I don't have much time to work out anymore, but... we'll see on the weekend, I guess?"
    mc "现在我已经没什么时间锻炼了，不过……说不定哪个周末可以抽空？"

# game/ep3.rpy:602
translate chinese klaraherapause_e4810ff7:

    # mc "I'll see if I can free up some time, but I can't promise."
    mc "我之后可以看情况安排一下，但我没法跟你保证。"

# game/ep3.rpy:666
translate chinese klaraherapause_38e34660:

    # a "Hmm... alright, sure! Let's go."
    a "嗯……好啊。走吧。"

# game/ep3.rpy:764
translate chinese klaraherapause_5577f901:

    # a "I may have a little experience, but it wasn't really much. So I'm still kind of... in a learning phase myself."
    a "我虽然有一点教学经验，但真的也只有一点。所以我自己……也算是一个学生。"

# game/ep3.rpy:765
translate chinese klaraherapause_a80ba73f:

    # a "Plus, I started in the middle of the school year."
    a "而且，我还是学期中间插班来的新老师。"

# game/ep3.rpy:769
translate chinese klaraherapause_d32452fd:

    # a "Hm? Why?"
    a "嗯？为什么？"

# game/ep3.rpy:801
translate chinese klaraherapause_0b6225e6:

    # mc "Eekk!"
    mc "我去！"

# game/ep3.rpy:804
translate chinese klaraherapause_ab3b5e96:

    # a "Oh, sorry. I was just so amused at how you're really focusing on reading my notes that I can't help but stare at you."
    a "哦，对不起。我看你那么专心地看我的笔记，感觉很好玩，就忍不住盯着你看了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:819
translate chinese klaraherapause_296e1692:

    # mc "Alright. Your lesson plan is already good as it is right now, so I think you don't have to worry about it."
    mc "好的。你的教学安排在我看来已经很不错了，我觉得你没必要太纠结这个。"

# game/ep3.rpy:820
translate chinese klaraherapause_017e97ba:

    # mc "And I can see that you're prioritizing efficiency which is good."
    mc "我能看出来你把效率排在首位，这很好。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1098
translate chinese ainepause3_7edc3d1f:

    # sc "I am, indeed. But I think it's time to pass the baton over."
    sc "确实是这样的。但我这一把年纪，是时候找人接班了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1099
translate chinese ainepause3_593e9cdc:

    # sc "Even if I do heal up, I don't think I can manage the hard work of being a repairman anymore."
    sc "哪怕伤养好了，估计也干不动这到处修东西的活儿啦。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1197
translate chinese ainepause3_47031c54:

    # mc "Yeah, she told me her bathtub faucet won't work, but I think she can explain it better."
    mc "是的，她跟我说是浴缸的水龙头坏了，但我觉得她应该能说得比我更清楚。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1277
translate chinese ainepause3_a6ab8d08:

    # n "Hmm... I have the right tools to fix the faucet right now."
    n "嗯……我带的工具修水龙头是没问题的。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1278
translate chinese ainepause3_1117818d:

    # n "However, dad didn't inform me of the second issue, so I haven't brought the tools for the sink."
    n "但是我爸没有跟我说厨房的事，所以我没带修水槽的工具。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1281
translate chinese ainepause3_711d888c:

    # n "Sorry, mate. But, I will have to return for it tomorrow."
    n "对不起，伙计。我只能明天再来修了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1282
translate chinese ainepause3_3c9913a8:

    # n "I still have somethin' to take care of right after this, so I won't be able to come back here today."
    n "我在你家忙完之后还得去城里到处跑，今天没时间再来一趟了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1376
translate chinese ainepause3_521cb8ad:

    # n "That's what we always say when someone tells us that we are pretty."
    n "有人夸自己漂亮的时候，大多数时候我们都会那么说。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1377
translate chinese ainepause3_27828662:

    # n "We may never look at ourselves like that, but to some people, we actually are."
    n "可能在自己看来确实并不算好看，但在别人眼里就不一样了。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1385
translate chinese ainepause3_5c08c208:

    # n "I do now, but I used to live in the countryside. I spent a lot of years there."
    n "现在是住在这边，但以前我住在乡下。我在乡下待了很久。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1386
translate chinese ainepause3_7ef142ff:

    # n "I came to move here recently when dad had an accident and I had to take care of him."
    n "我爸前段时间出了点事，我得搬来照顾他。"

# game/ep3.rpy:1407
translate chinese ainepause3_0fb00a02:

    # a "Huh? No, no, no! It's nothing like that!"
    a "啊？不不不！根本不是那样的！"

# game/ep3.rpy:1417
