    f "既然妈妈不在家，今天是个直播的好日子，没人会来打扰我。嘿嘿！"

# game/ep3.rpy:3241
translate chinese emmapause2_16fa4a40:

    # mc "*sighs* Your personality hasn't changed at all."
    mc "*叹气* 你的性格真是一点也没变。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3245
translate chinese emmapause2_c7fd0e0e:

    # g "So you're saying that you really know me well, then?"
    g "你这么说，是代表是你很了解我咯？"

# game/ep3.rpy:3254
translate chinese emmapause2_c0958c1c:

    # mc "Considering what I just discovered?"
    mc "不……考虑到我甚至刚刚才对你有了新的认识……"

# game/ep3.rpy:3255
translate chinese emmapause2_03c2c08e:

    # mc "Nope. I don't know what more secrets you have up your sleeve, to be honest."
    mc "我只能说我并不很了解你。说实话我不知道你身上还藏着多少秘密。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3257
translate chinese emmapause2_29616125:

    # mc "I just perceived you as a drunkard and... well... someone who smokes."
    mc "我只是把你当成酒鬼还有……嗯……爱吸烟的人。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3258
translate chinese emmapause2_322bac72:

    # mc "I was even surprised to know that you own a company."
    mc "我甚至连知道你名下有家公司的时候都吓了一跳。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3262
translate chinese emmapause2_b9af495c:

    # g "Well, brooding about it won't really help me."
    g "毕竟一直烦心也没有用啊。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3263
translate chinese emmapause2_660be329:

    # g "The problem is already a problem, so instead of thinking about the problem, I'll just think about the solution."
    g "问题都已经是问题了。所以我就不再想问题本身了，而是想解决的办法。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3267
translate chinese emmapause2_3a4a3603:

    # g "Let's not talk about that, shall we?"
    g "现在就别谈那些了，好吧？"

# game/ep3.rpy:3268
translate chinese emmapause2_341d3f0b:

    # g "All I want for now is to relax and take my mind off of all the stress it caused me before going out there again for another journey."
    g "我现在只想放空思绪，远离压力，为我人生中的下一场旅程做准备。"

# game/ep3.rpy:3300
translate chinese emmapause2_6ae76b4e:

    # g "...Me lying on mom's lap... while she brushed my hair until I fell asleep..."
    g "……我睡在妈妈的腿上……她就轻轻地摸我的头发，一直到我睡着……"

# game/ep3.rpy:3301
translate chinese emmapause2_b53275ee:

    # g "...We were all living in bliss, like one happy family would... until..."
